# Vue & PWA

- SFCs: `<script setup lang="ts">`. Composition API only.
- Follow existing Prettier/ESLint (no semicolons, single quotes).
- User-facing copy: Russian only. No «household» / «Invite» in UI.
- Create/edit of expense, income, transfer, purchase, account, rules: bottom drawers, not pages.
- Auth: email+password. No household onboarding. Unauthenticated → login; session → app.
- Layout/theme/tokens: read `docs/SPEC.md` § Design only when changing them.
- PWA: `vite-plugin-pwa` + IndexedDB replica + mutation outbox. Server is source of truth after sync. Do not add a third-party sync service.
- Do not invent a CSS framework. Scoped/local styles unless shared tokens exist.
